  "title": "DLSw: Reset loop counter when dissecting capabilities vectors",
  "description": "Summary:\n\nIn dissect_dlsw_capex(), loop counter i was initialized once at function entry. When parsing vector 0x86 (Supported SAP List), i is incremented while decoding SAP subfields. If multiple 0x86 vectors exist in the capabilities exchange PDU, subsequent vectors were skipped because i retained its previous value.\n\nChanges:\n\n\\- Converted while loop to a for loop starting at i = 0 for each vector.\n\n\\- Verified with tools/check_apis.py (0 warnings).",
