      "title": "DLSw: Reset loop counter when dissecting capabilities vectors",
      "message": "DLSw: Reset loop counter when dissecting capabilities vectors\n\nIn dissect_dlsw_capex(), loop counter i was initialized once at function entry. For vector 0x86 (Supported SAP List), i is incremented while dissecting SAP subfields. If multiple 0x86 vectors are present in the same capabilities exchange PDU, subsequent vectors were skipped because i was not reinitialized to 0.\n\nConvert the while loop to a for loop starting at i = 0 for each vector.",
